# Visual Studio local state.
# NOTE: this repository is synced to S3 verbatim, so anything committed here is
# PUBLICLY DOWNLOADABLE on awscommunity.pk. .vs/slnx.sqlite (282 KB) and
# .vs/.../applicationhost.config (82 KB) are currently served live. These rules
# stop NEW ones appearing; removing the already-committed files is a separate
# decision tracked in docs/restructure-plan.md item 2a.
